cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Build Your Ride AR
message: >-
  If you use this software or reference this work, please cite it
  using the metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Sathvik
    family-names: Koti
abstract: >-
  An Android augmented-reality car configurator built in Unity with
  AR Foundation and ARCore. Places a real-world-scale, plane-anchored
  3D car in the room, with live paint customization, real-world light
  estimation, contact-shadow grounding, depth occlusion, and a
  generic FBX-to-playable-car import pipeline. A full rebuild of an
  earlier university 3D Vision module project, aimed at fixing that
  version's anchoring drift and flat visual integration.
keywords:
  - augmented reality
  - Unity
  - AR Foundation
  - ARCore
  - mobile AR
  - 3D configurator
license: MIT
repository-code: 'https://github.com/SATHv1kk/build-your-ride-ar'
